 * g_n_elems_after_sessions: the elem-pool checkpoint right after
 * sessions last rebuilt - lets inject_panel_feed() rewind ONLY its own
 * portion of the pool when feed is dirty but sessions isn't, instead
 * of wiping sessions' already-valid Elems too. */
